    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A: Raise adaptive current. Its duration, regeneration, water resistance and shield grow with the round; missing health adds defense. S: Adaptive breath heals from missing health and defense, then restores stamina based on round. Z: Pressure lance scales lightning damage with target health, attack and round; its stamina cost also rises by round. B resolves. Inspect current previews, status descriptions and simulator traces. ",
